---
description: UX guidelines — spacing, typography, color, mobile, interaction
globs: "**/*.{tsx,jsx,vue,svelte}, **/components/**/*, **/*.{css,scss}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Mirror of `aidlc/rules/ux-guidelines.md` — keep in sync.

- Spacing: 4px grid. Tokens: 4/8/12/16/24/32/48px.
- Type: display 32+/700, h1 28/700, h2 22/600, h3 18/600, body 16/400, small 14/400, micro 12/400. Min 12px. Micro for timestamps only.
- Color: primary=actions, destructive=irreversible (confirm first), success, warning, muted. Never color-only — pair with icon/label.
- Mobile: 44×44pt min tap, primary CTA above fold, no horizontal overflow, correct input types, bottom sheet > modal.
- Interaction: transitions 200-300ms ease-out, feedback 100-150ms. Skeleton for loads >300ms. Optimistic UI for toggles/likes/saves.
